\[\frac{2^n}{1 + 2^n + 2^{n + 1} + 2^{2n + 1}} = \frac{2^n}{(1 + 2^n)(1 + 2^{n + 1})} = \frac{1}{1 + 2^n} - \frac{1}{1 + 2^{n + 1}}.\]Finally,
