accepted_response:
This is an arithmetic sequence with a starting term $a_1 = 147,$ common difference $-3,$ and the final term $a_n = 39.$  Applying the formula $a_n = a_1 + (n - 1)d$ gives \begin{align*}
39 &= 147 - 3(n - 1)\\
3(n - 1) &= 147 - 39\\
n - 1 &= \frac{108}{3} = 36 \quad \Rightarrow \quad n = \boxed{37}.
\end{align*}
