accepted_response:
We first calculate the overall area of the rectangle, then subtract out the area of the square that wasn't used. That is \begin{align*}
(15 ft)(12ft)- (3ft)^2 &= 180 ft^2 - 9 ft^2\\
&= \boxed{171} ft^2.
\end{align*}
